Package: microscope
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: lucaswewa <lucaswewa@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: libc6 (>= @GLIBC@)
Section: science
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/lucaswewa/microscope
Description: Microscope control software, as a service
 The microscope server, which systemd runs as the microscope service. It
 serves the camera, the stage, the routines built on them and the web app,
 on port 5000 of this machine. Its address and port are set in
 /etc/default/microscope, and its microscope in /etc/microscope/config.json.
 .
 microscope-launcher is installed too, to run a microscope without the
 service.
